pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: nav-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 0, 400, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$white"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>03 提出的解决方案</p>
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>每个阶段都有失败处理机制</strong></p>
  - elementId: intro
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 110, 1160, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>工程上的关键设计是<strong>失败保留（failure retention）</strong>，而不是失败丢弃：</p>
  - elementId: failure-table
    elementType: table
    bounds: [60, 160, 1160, 280]
    columnWidths: [0.25, 0.35, 0.4]
    rowHeights: [0.14, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.17, 0.18]
    style: "$default"
    rows:
      - - content: {text: "失败类型"}
        - content: {text: "处理方式"}
        - content: {text: "产物"}
      - - content: {text: "Capture 失败"}
        - content: {text: "保留 BRAM dump 和失败原因"}
        - content: {text: "raw dump + failure log"}
      - - content: {text: "Gate 失败"}
        - content: {text: "marker 不完整 / seq 缺口 / drop/wrap"}
        - content: {text: "retained_failed_attempts，不进入 PASS"}
      - - content: {text: "Context binding 失败"}
        - content: {text: "ELF/runtime 缺失或歧义"}
        - content: {text: "降级或 block，不强行 claim"}
      - - content: {text: "Semantic recovery 失败"}
        - content: {text: "syscall 不可配对 / 字段不可解释"}
        - content: {text: "boundary evidence"}
      - - content: {text: "数据溯源检查失败"}
        - content: {text: "验证基准字段被标为 hardware-only"}
        - content: {text: "checker 拒绝，不进入 report"}
  - elementId: bottom-note-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 460, 1160, 80]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "#FEF3C7"
  - elementId: bottom-note-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 470, 1120, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>这直接回应了"成功是不是事后挑选出来的"这一质疑：14 个失败尝试被完整保留，它们不参与 accepted 统计，但参与 robustness 审计。</p>
  - elementId: footer
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 680, 400, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>RV-MalTrace 深度技术汇报</p>
  - elementId: page-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1180, 680, 60, 30]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>15</p>
